Included source:
- The Go binding packages of bpf-mlir (bindrt, requirements, layout, livecaps,
  the internal core, kload, tpattach and usdtattach packages, and ebpf-bindgen),
  copied from bpf-mlir commit ea262bb524e666c44b272e19d3893a851164fb0a (a
  descendant of the commit of the bpf-mlir v1.21.0 source release, 41b188568cb3…,
  that differs only in Go comments and error-message numbers; the source release
  does not ship them) with
  their import paths rewritten. bpf-mlir is Copyright (c) 2026 Yusuke Shinozaki
  and licensed under Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.

